/// ```text
/// --<boundary>CRLF
/// Content-Disposition: form-data; name="<name>"[; filename="<name>"]CRLF
/// Content-Type: <mime>CRLF       (only for bytes parts)
/// CRLF
/// <value bytes>CRLF
/// ```
